<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "黒,中の人" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Allow me to introduce myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am―
{PAUSE ""}
Haruka Niimura.<PG>
The same Haruka Niimura that <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama has been watching all this time.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
First, I must offer my apologies. 
{PAUSE ""}
For using a false name all this time, for never showing my true face, and for continuing to deceive <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama, I am deeply sorry.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
As you saw, I stabbed Natsumi Kogori to death with a knife.<PG>
This is an undeniable fact, and Natsumi's blood that sprayed onto me is still soaked into my whole body, even now.<PG>
And at some point, one of my eyes had turned green. 
{PAUSE ""}
Like Chiga-nee's, and Kana's.<PG>
I did not want to kill her, and yet I killed her. 
{PAUSE ""}
As if a curse had been laid on me, I was tormented by an intense murderous intent toward Natsumi, took up the knife that was in the closet, and with this hand―
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
